<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Lever Bros 9-mth profits lower.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Lever Bros 9-mth profits lower.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months result for Lever Bros Nigeria Plc to end-September 1996. (In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1996	1995</p>
<p>Turnover		     6,300   vs 6,200</p>
<p>Profit before taxation   1,340   vs 1,700</p>
<p>Taxation			 340.8 vs   614.1</p>
<p>Profit after taxation    1,000   vs 1,100</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
